      "text": "Inside the purple-gold shell"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "The caravan is in. Unusual Gu, overpriced, and a gambling-stone stall that prices uncertainty better than most clans price certainty.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "narrator",
      "text": "The stall prices what is inside the shell by the weight of the shell. Men crouch over the tray, turning the stones to the lamp and back.",
      "kind": "narration",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "face",
      "actor": "caravan-merchant",
      "target": "fang-yuan"
    },
    {
      "op": "gesture",
      "actor": "caravan-merchant",
      "gesture": "talk-point"
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 40,
      "text": "Chapter 40"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Lost four stones on two shells. The merchant is honest in the way a scale is honest: he does not cheat, he simply knows the odds he is selling.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 41,
      "text": "Chapter 41"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Bought a Mudskin Toad Gu, mostly so that the rest of what I bought would look like an afterthought. Minor protection. Its real function is to be the thing I talk about.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 42,
      "text": "Chapter 42"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Watched the stall long enough to learn which shells the merchant handles gently. A purple-gold shell is sealed, and a sealed shell can have contained anything.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
